    "ssky_text_image_block_c7gT9i": {
      "type": "ssky-text-image-block",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_jjzfdb": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<h2>Are you sick and tired of others pushing an agenda on your kids?</h2>",
            "heading_size": "h0",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_Vchx6B": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For longer than you’ve been alive, the government has manipulated the public and pushed its agenda of printing money, reducing our freedom, and outright lying to us. This is the world our kids are growing up in.</p><p>And it’s not just the government. The school system, the mainstream media, and the entertainment industry all push socialism and harmful ideas into the minds of children every day. They have become enemies to freedom-loving Americans.</p><p>You want your children to have the best chance of success in life and to learn about true history, sound money, personal freedom and responsibility, entrepreneurship, individual rights, and more.</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_jjzfdb",
        "text_Vchx6B"
