            "heading_size": "h0",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "caption_MLQTLi": {
          "type": "caption",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "As Your Kids Are Exposed to False Ideas by Teachers, Textbooks and TikTok.",
            "text_style": "large-bold",
            "color_class": ""
          }
        },
        "text_68GUUQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>You have probably been looking for quality curricula for your children beyond just math, music, and science. You are also irritated and angered by the bias, censorship, and distortion of truth that is happening in schools and the media.</p><p>You’re probably worn out from having to worry about all of this, wondering who you can trust to help teach your kids. It’s become a full-time job just to keep your family focused on what really matters.</p><p>If you feel frustrated by the way twisted history and bad ideas are being taught to your kids, then it’s time for you to do something about it.</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
