    "ssky_text_block_H3aDzy": {
      "type": "ssky-text-block",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_U7DDVW": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<h2>Above All… You Really Just Want to See Your Children Grow up Happy, Healthy and Well Rounded — Untainted by the Relentless Brainwashing from Media and Government Disinformation.</h2>",
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "center",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "center": false
          }
        },
        "caption_AnUwEz": {
          "type": "caption",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "And at the end of the day it feels like you are getting smashed in the waves trying to keep a level head in all the insanity.",
            "custom_color": "",
            "text_style": "small-bold",
            "color_class": "blue-text"
          }
        },
        "text_VrQJdb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 80,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "center",
            "text": "<p>Perhaps you have tried in the past to teach your kids about what’s happening in our world and couldn’t find the right way to do it:</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold"
          }
        },
        "text_with_icon_TJpyeR": {
          "type": "text_with_icon",
          "settings": {
            "alignment": "left",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group_102860.png",
            "text": "<p>A trip to the <strong>Local Library </strong>in search of good literature results in frustration that many books are pushing harmful agendas that are appealing to kids. You wonder what good material you can introduce to your children that they’ll actually enjoy.</p>",
            "custom_color": "",
            "icon_b": "shopify://shop_images/Group_102860.png",
            "text_b": "<p>After finding <strong>YouTube Videos </strong>from creators that seemed good at the time for your kids, you discovered that they ultimately had some agenda and were using their platform to promote ideas you strongly disagree with.</p>",
            "custom_color_b": ""
          }
        },
        "text_with_icon_Ytm77D": {
          "type": "text_with_icon",
          "settings": {
            "alignment": "left",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group_102860.png",
            "text": "<p>You have broached big subjects in <strong>Family Discussions </strong>after dinner that end up in silence from apathetic kids or end awkwardly when your kids ask questions you can’t answer.</p>",
            "custom_color": "",
            "icon_b": "shopify://shop_images/Group_102860.png",
            "text_b": "<p>Perhaps you use <strong>Current Events </strong>to try and educate your child about what is happening but there is no context and it’s too complex to explain. Often, you wonder if what you’re doing is enough to “stick” and prepare your children for the world they’re growing up in.</p>",
            "custom_color_b": ""
          }
        },
        "text_YkRYGN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 80,
            "custom_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "alignment": "center",
            "text": "<p>You want your kids to know the truth about how things really work in the world, so you can’t let them fall for the lies and manipulations of those who want to control them.</p><p>The solution to this emerging education problem may be simpler than you think.</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "semibold"
          }
        },
        "caption_pHTgHy": {
          "type": "caption",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "As a parent you can now feel empowered to give your family a foundation of freedom and encourage your children to think critically about the (many) bad ideas swirling around in our society.",
            "custom_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_style": "medium-semibold",
            "color_class": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_U7DDVW",
